| Helm (d49f3ae3-415a-4215-8471-eedd5ad1829b) | `pkg/chart/v2/util/chartfile_test.go` | Unit tests for chartfile utilities that will need updating |
| Helm (d49f3ae3-415a-4215-8471-eedd5ad1829b) | `internal/chart/v3/util/chartfile_test.go` | Unit tests for v3 chartfile utilities |
| Helm (d49f3ae3-415a-4215-8471-eedd5ad1829b) | `pkg/chart/v2/lint/rules/chartfile.go` | Uses chart metadata for validation - may need updates |
